saumadattis tathaiva ca\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":233,\"bb\":220,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/8/b220/\",\"shadow_value\":\"bhavān – your good self; bhīṣmaḥ – Grandfather Bhīṣma; ca – also; karṇaḥ – Karṇa; ca – and; kṛpaḥ – Kṛpa; ca – and; samitim-jayaḥ – always victorious in battle; aśvatthāmā – Aśvatthāmā; vikarṇaḥ – Vikarṇa; ca – as well as; saumadattiḥ – the son of Somadatta; tathā – as well as; eva – certainly; ca – also.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"bhavān\",\"translation\":\"your good self\"},{\"word\":\"bhīṣmaḥ\",\"translation\":\"Grandfather Bhīṣma\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"karṇaḥ\",\"translation\":\"Karṇa\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"kṛpaḥ\",\"translation\":\"Kṛpa\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"samitim-jayaḥ\",\"translation\":\"always victorious in battle\"},{\"word\":\"aśvatthāmā\",\"translation\":\"Aśvatthāmā\"},{\"word\":\"vikarṇaḥ\",\"translation\":\"Vikarṇa\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"as well as\"},{\"word\":\"saumadattiḥ\",\"translation\":\"the son of Somadatta\"},{\"word\":\"tathā\",\"translation\":\"as well as\"},{\"word\":\"eva\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":234,\"bb\":221,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/8/b221/\",\"body_value\":\"There are personalities like you, Bhīṣma, Karṇa, Kṛpa, Aśvatthāmā, Vikarṇa and the son of Somadatta called Bhūriśravā, who are always victorious in battle.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":235,\"bb\":222,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/8/b222/\",\"body_value\":\"Duryodhana mentions the exc