sarve yuddha-viśāradāḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":239,\"bb\":225,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/9/b225/\",\"shadow_value\":\"anye – others; ca – also; bahavaḥ – in great numbers; śūrāḥ – heroes; mat-arthe – for my sake; tyakta-jīvitāḥ – prepared to risk life; nānā – many; śastra – weapons; praharaṇāḥ – equipped with; sarve – all of them; yuddha-viśāradāḥ – experienced in military science.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"anye\",\"translation\":\"others\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"bahavaḥ\",\"translation\":\"in great numbers\"},{\"word\":\"śūrāḥ\",\"translation\":\"heroes\"},{\"word\":\"mat-arthe\",\"translation\":\"for my sake\"},{\"word\":\"tyakta-jīvitāḥ\",\"translation\":\"prepared to risk life\"},{\"word\":\"nānā\",\"translation\":\"many\"},{\"word\":\"śastra\",\"translation\":\"weapons\"},{\"word\":\"praharaṇāḥ\",\"translation\":\"equipped with\"},{\"word\":\"sarve\",\"translation\":\"all of them\"},{\"word\":\"yuddha-viśāradāḥ\",\"translation\":\"experienced in military science\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":240,\"bb\":226,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/9/b226/\",\"body_value\":\"There are many other heroes who are prepared to lay down their lives for my sake. All of them are well equipped with different kinds of weapons, and all are experienced in military science.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":241,\"bb\":227,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/1/9/b227/\",\"body_value\":\"As far as the others are concerned – like Jayadratha, Kṛtavarmā and Śalya – all are determined to lay down their lives for Duryodhana’s sake. In other words, it is already concluded that all of them wou